@startuml Sequence Diagram - Use Case UC-01A (Sign Up)
autonumber
actor "Anonymous Guest" as guest
participant "FastAPI Router\n[AuthRouter]" as router
participant "Validation Layer\n[UserSignUpRequest]" as schema
participant "Application Service\n[AuthUseCaseService]" as service
participant "Domain Cryptography\n[AuthCryptoService]" as crypto
participant "Data Infrastructure Port\n[AuthRepository]" as repo
database "PostgreSQL DB" as db

guest -> router: POST /api/v1/auth/signup (JSON payload)
activate router

== Alternative Flow B: Inbound Parsing Trap ==
router -> schema: Parse & validate body dictionary shapes
activate schema
alt fields invalid (weak password length, malformed email format)
    schema --> router: Raise ValidationError (Pydantic rule break)
    router --> guest: HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity
end
deactivate schema

== Main Flow Initialization ==
router -> service: register_new_user(email, password)
activate service

service -> repo: find_by_email(email)
activate repo
repo -> db: SELECT users WHERE email = requested_email
activate db
db --> repo: user record data or null
deactivate db
repo --> service: User instance | None
deactivate repo

== Alternative Flow A: Duplicate Account Check Failure ==
alt User instance is NOT None (Email already mapped in schema catalogs)
    service --> router: Raise AccountConflictException
    router --> guest: HTTP 400 Bad Request ("Email is registered")
end

== Data Transformation & Persistence ==
service -> crypto: hash_password(plain_password)
activate crypto
crypto --> service: custom_hashed_string (bcrypt transformation)
deactivate crypto

service -> service: Instantiate Aggregate Entity: User(email, hashed_password)

service -> repo: save_user(user_instance)
activate repo
repo -> db: INSERT INTO users (email, hashed_password)
activate db
db --> repo: Transaction committed successfully + generated ID
deactivate db
repo --> service: Hydrated User Instance (with ID, timestamps)
deactivate repo

service --> router: Return clean User aggregate object
deactivate service

router -> router: Serialize model fields onto UserResponseEnvelope
router --> guest: HTTP 201 Created (Clean serialized dictionary envelope)
deactivate router
@enduml